cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "atmo3d: An Interactive Viewer for 3D Atmospheric Data"
abstract: >-
  atmo3d is an interactive, browser-based viewer for 3D atmospheric data: CM1
  model output, WoFS and other WRF ensembles, and radar volumes (CfRadial and
  NEXRAD Level II). It runs next to the data, usually on a cluster, and provides
  plan-view maps, soundings, storm tracking, cross-sections, 3D scenes, parcel
  analysis, time series and publication figures.
authors:
